{"id":"e317109be82f65fa","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-congruence-distributive.md","title":"Congruence Distributive","display":"df-congruence-distributive — Congruence Distributive","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-congruence-distributive","aliases":["93-df-congruence-distributive"],"display":"df-congruence-distributive — Congruence Distributive","depends_on":["[[93-df-variety]]","[[93-df-congruence-lattice]]","[[93-df-distributive-lattice]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-congruence-distributive"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-congruence-distributive</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-congruence-distributive — Congruence Distributive"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" href=\"?note=f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" title=\"93-df-variety\">93-df-variety</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"135c0cfcbae1f3c5\" href=\"?note=135c0cfcbae1f3c5\" title=\"93-df-congruence-lattice\">93-df-congruence-lattice</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fc98242032b14823\" href=\"?note=fc98242032b14823\" title=\"93-df-distributive-lattice\">93-df-distributive-lattice</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> is fixed and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConLat}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{ConLat}_{93}\\)</span> (congruence-lattice constructor, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"135c0cfcbae